{"title": "Muscular", "pageid": 4331, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Muscular", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Muscular_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/b/bc/Muscular_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Muscular_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Muscular</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> when using <a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\">Athletics</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature is very strong. It has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> using <a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\">Athletics</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gilded_Minotaur\" title=\"Gilded Minotaur\">Gilded Minotaur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Glut</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Minotaur\" title=\"Minotaur\">Minotaur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Spaw</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Has advantage on ability checks and saving throws using Athletics.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205020\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 628/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3020/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1685/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 340/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643651/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.457      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.457      1 -total\n 30.47%    9.281      1 Template:Advantage\n 29.54%    8.998      1 Template:Icon_link\n 28.49%    8.677      1 Template:Icon_text\n 25.03%    7.624      2 Template:Trim\n 22.21%    6.765      1 Template:Ifempty\n 21.55%    6.564      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.79%    4.200      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.34%    3.453      1 Template:Pa